<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lifetime Hoan cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lifetime Hoan cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it reduced the rating on Lifetime Hoan Corp to buy-market performer from buy-focus.</p>
<p>-- company said earlier Wednesday it expected first quarter net income of $1.3 million compared with $1.7 million for the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped two to nine on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
